Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighteenth Episode\NThe Magic Mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The best soup in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It has such a delicious scent\Nthat it makes your mouth water!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Princess Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have prepared an excellent soup for you.\NI recommend you eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.06,0:02:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to eat. You know that\NI eat one grain of rice a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can you sustain yourself\Non a grain of rice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you\Nthat I don't want to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be careful\Nnot to ruin my figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to make me fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no... I am so sorry, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear magic mirror,\Nplease, tell me:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,who is the most beautiful in all creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, my dear Bella.\NIf you want to know, I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the universe, of course, I do not know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but of this country\Nyou are the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, gentle and royal Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,consider yourself satisfied\Nwith your beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.26,0:03:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent! I am sure that a woman\Nmore beautiful than me cannot exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure of it by traveling through\Nall the regions of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is! I'm almost right over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!\NIt's really a nice little hare!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! I saw it! There\Nit is! Now I'll catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And with this one, that\Nmakes 11 hares! Not bad, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Opale!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In mid-air! Like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With these, I've caught 12!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What bad luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found more! Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Three in one go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was better\Noff before, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Grand Duke? Did you\Nthink I would end up defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to skill\Nand dexterity, I'm no sissy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Actually, I proposed it to you\Nbecause it's a very manly game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I won, it means\Nthat I'm very manly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Answer! - So it would seem,\Nby all accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If he still isn't convinced, I'll have to\Ngive him another demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But what kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!\NHow big this carriage is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It even has an upper level\Nand looks very luxurious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous!\NLook, there are stairs too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible! It's divided\Ninto rooms, like a house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is missing!\NThere's even a kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who the lucky person is who lives\Nin a carriage like this...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!\NA real bedroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! What a strange mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why it doesn't reflect\None's figure properly...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to look at myself in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it has become normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Make essences\Nwith the flowers you have gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's someone!\N- There's someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thief!\N- No, wait! I'm not a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry to have frightened you, but I...\N- What is it, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no!\N- You'll have to deal with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just let me catch you and...\N- There's a misunderstanding! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That scoundrel got you\Ndirty, but now I'll clean you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, my dear mirror,\Nmy magic mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me:\Nwho is the most beautiful in creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear Beauty,\Nif you wish, I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the world I do not know, but of this\Nplace you are no longer the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept my invitation:\Nresign yourself to fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,for nearby\Nis one more beautiful than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that in this country\Nthere is one more beautiful than me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My Princess, it is true.\NWhat I assert this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...you will see of the realm\Nin the next castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you will be informed of a beauty that\Nis enclosed upon all this earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire she is named.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like dying at the thought\Nof no longer being the most beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My little Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Better that indiscreet\Nears do not hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- that I call you like a little girl.\N- Yes, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what tenderness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How I wish you could grow up\Nas a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,without being forced\Nto hide your identity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,..because of our laws!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our laws are the most precious\Npossession we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do not observe them,\Nthe people will not forgive us
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my little Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you desire?\N- I am looking for a certain Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you know who she is?\N- Yes, Sapphire is the King's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She lives in the nearby castle
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.70,0:09:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is true\Nthat there is this girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's run to the castle!\N- Right away, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, I was wrong!\NSapphire is a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a strong and brave\Nboy! He is not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you sure\Nthat Sapphire is a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am sure of it! My\Nmagic mirror never lies...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...and it claims exactly that. It also\Nsaid that she is more beautiful than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean you have\Na magic mirror?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it is truly a stroke of luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It is good fortune that\Nsends you here to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I would like to see\NSapphire. I must verify...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...if the mirror is right, if she is\Nreally more beautiful than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, I understand!\NDon't worry, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will call her for you shortly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you waiting for?\N- Things are getting interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,because there is a secret involved\Nthat finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...through you\Nit will be possible to reveal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get a little practice,\NNylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- But you are the thief from yesterday!\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can beat you even with this!\NCome on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm out of practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Step forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You are as weak as a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you admit your defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat? No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my castle,\NPrincess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about yesterday.\NI am Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I must tell you that I have never seen\Na girl more beautiful than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You are enchanting!\NTruly very beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness.\NBut are you really a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you doubt it? I have even\Nadmired your beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon,\NI'll even grow a mustache
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens,\NI prefer not to look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I believe you.\NIndeed, I hope you won't be offended,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,if I tell you that I find you\Nrather ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You teased me by saying\Nthat Sapphire was more beautiful than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be serious and tell me:\Nwho is the most beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is that:\NSapphire is the most beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.38,0:11:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sapphire is a boy! Do you want\Nto keep teasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What seems to be, is not.\NBelieve what you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem so at all,\Nbut Sapphire is a maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We would be honored if you\Nstayed a little longer in Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept, because I have to\Nsettle a matter close to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know what it is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see... I have to convince\Nthe mirror that I am the most beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I understand you!\NThen allow me to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...and to offer you\Nhospitality in my nearby castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you, Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to take you to the\Nbest inn in the entire realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not. I prefer to\Nreside in the palace of the mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...that Chop will build for me.\N- I'll build it right away, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But Your Highness, surely you don't\Nwant to have a palace built for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that I\Ncan stay in an inn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as it's done, come to\Nmy palace. I will receive you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I've given\Nmyself away, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be careful, because\NBella might discover your secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, now you should\Nbehave more manly than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but in what way\Ncan I seem more manly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think a bit\Nabout this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! You look more\Nmanly when you fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When I fight, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sapphire! She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.02,0:12:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats a good\Nglass of beer with friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you blockheads! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight! Bella is watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, Sapphire!\NShow them your manly spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- That Prince doesn't seem like a girl.\N- He doesn't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a pity, so big...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or this one! I changed my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a struggle!\N- Well done, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had known\Nthat you were watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have fought\Nmore bravely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept the invitation\Nto come to my palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will be very happy to receive you.\N- In your palace?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! It will be called\N'Mirror Palace".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Palace?!\NA truly strange name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you know,\Nit hasn't been built yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You want to build yourself a palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it will be built in five\Nminutes. Please, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds interesting!\NI accept your invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful,\Nit could be a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I remembered that I have to\Nreturn to the castle to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you study.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Studying is certainly not\Nfor brave people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, if you think so,\Nit means I won't study.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then remember that I'm waiting for you.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want it to be built here.\N- Yes, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already built.\NYou can enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't understand\Nhow it was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...to build it so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, a\Nboy who is afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm not afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me in the\Nback room, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll see! If it's a\Ngirl, she will faint from fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:16:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I found him passed out\Nin front of the multi-mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the maids to dress Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,..in a woman's dress\Nand put makeup on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as she is ready, I will compare\Nmyself with her to see who is the most beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It will all be done, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We have finished putting makeup on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful! I am shocked!\NShe is indeed very beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror, my mirror,\Ntell me once again:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,who is more beautiful? Sapphire or I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Satisfaction is not granted to you,\Nthe answer is ever the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if over seas and mountains\Nyou have traveled satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the illusion that your supremacy\Nover the world does not fade..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...gives way to despair\Nfor a dream that is now dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the realm, the most beautiful\Nis Sapphire, always her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- My loyal servant..\N- Yes, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire must no longer live.\N- As you wish, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who is more beautiful than me\Nmust be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It shall be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.86,0:17:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to kill Sapphire\Nat all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Away, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,First let's test this weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This time you won't escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!\NThat mirror on the wall..!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I will turn this weapon\Nagainst them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we shall see!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! The palace is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella, run away!\NRun away, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The palace will collapse on you!\NPrincess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.34,0:20:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of this cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in danger!\NLet me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess! There is not a minute\Nto lose! Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are not\Ncapable of killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really want me to die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be the one to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but you will die buried\Nunder the rubble of this palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.34,0:20:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, finally,\NI will be the most beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,of this kingdom\Nand of the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My magic mirror\Nis collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My duty as a mirror\Nis over. I was already old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you are no longer the first,\Nyou, of my rhyming verdicts...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...will no longer hear my voice\Nto know who is the fairest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Satisfied, I retire\Nand give the palm to Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bella!\N- I must flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella, let me out!\NPlease! Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Bella! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want to show you again\Nwhat you are going to become.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It is not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your springtime fades,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you will take on your true appearance\Nand this is how you will become,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,because indeed within you there is ugliness.\NOnly on the outside is there beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This identity of yours,\Nif you do not change, will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to suggest to you\Na remedy, to finish:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,if you change your heart inside\Nand show a little love,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you will return serene and beautiful\Nand Sapphire, just as she was,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,she will become your great friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is, more than words can say,\Nthe beauty of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.78,0:22:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have finished.\NGoodbye, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bella, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.54,0:22:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come, quickly!\N- Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, Sapphire, I...\N- Don't say anything. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!\NYou are still the most beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.38,0:23:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. I have understood\Nwhat true beauty is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.06,0:23:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This gift will make you\Nremember my friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How dear you are, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.10,0:23:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- Goodbye!
